          <plain>
            <text x="12.7" y="579.12" size="2.54" layer="94">PROJECT FRIDAY — S4: RK3576 (U1) POWER, GROUND, DECOUPLING &amp; UNUSED BLOCKS — EVB P.10-19 &amp; HDG S2 | REV SCH-1 | PRINCIPLE: COPY RK3576 EVB1 V1.2</text>
