        <sheet>
          <plain>
            <text x="12.7" y="281.94" size="2.54" layer="94">PROJECT FRIDAY - S8: eMMC 5.1 x8 | REV SCH-2</text>
            <text x="12.7" y="274.32" size="1.778" layer="94">Hynix pp. 6-7, 54 (Table 14); RK3576 HDG pp. 19-20, 159; VCCIO0 at 1.8 V.</text>
            <text x="25.4" y="67.31" size="1.778" layer="94">eMMC VCCQ (1.8 V), VCC (3.3 V) and VDDI bypass</text>
            <text x="223.52" y="218.44" size="1.778" layer="94">Place R4000 close to U1 (HDG p. 159).</text>
            <text x="25.4" y="144.78" size="1.778" layer="94">R4010 is DNP by default. DS connects directly to U1.</text>
          </plain>
